# Written by PanelAlpha.
#
# The inner half of the rule in ../.htaccess. Group Office's installer is
# unauthenticated from end to end -- configfile.php rewrites ../config.php from
# POST fields (configfile.php:103-112), install.php makes whoever posts it the
# System Administrator (install.php:71-85), and upgrade.php runs schema
# migrations for the life of the installation, not only before it is installed.
#
# The install and the upgrade both run from ../panelalpha-install.php in a CLI
# process on the install and upgrade stages, before Apache binds, with an
# administrator password generated per account into
# ~/.panelalpha/groupoffice-admin-password.
#
# If you need the web upgrader for a migration this recipe will not do, delete
# this file and the RedirectMatch in ../.htaccess, run it, and put them back.
Require all denied
